ModuleDoliSecureName = DoliSecure
ModuleDoliSecureDesc = Checks that the installed Dolibarr version is not affected by any known vulnerability (CVE) and shows an indicator, visible to administrators only, on the home page
DoliSecureDescription = Checks that the installed Dolibarr version is not affected by any known vulnerability (CVE) and shows an indicator, visible to administrators only, on the home page

#
# Admin page
#
DoliSecureSetup = DoliSecure setup
Settings = Settings
DoliSecureSetupPage = This module periodically checks the installed Dolibarr version against the NVD (NIST) vulnerability database and shows an indicator, visible to administrators only, on the home page.
DOLISECURE_CACHE_DELAY_HOURS = Delay before next check (hours)
DOLISECURE_CACHE_DELAY_HOURSTooltip = Number of hours the last result is reused before a new online check is performed
DOLISECURE_SHOW_OK_BANNER = Show indicator even when no vulnerability is found
DOLISECURE_SHOW_OK_BANNERTooltip = If enabled, a green indicator is shown on the home page even when no vulnerability is detected
DOLISECURE_SEND_ADMIN_ALERT = Send an email to administrators on vulnerability
DOLISECURE_SEND_ADMIN_ALERTTooltip = An email is sent automatically when a new vulnerability is detected (only once as long as the set of vulnerabilities does not change)
DOLISECURE_ALERT_EMAIL = Alert recipient(s) (optional)
DOLISECURE_ALERT_EMAILTooltip = Comma-separated list of email addresses. Leave empty to automatically notify all active users flagged as administrator

